  {
   "id": "hello-kitty-island-adventure-254871@post-2026-06-11",
   "gameId": "hello-kitty-island-adventure-254871",
   "displayName": "CU7 is Available Right Now!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-11T18:35:58.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "That’s right! CU7 is out now!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "What’s inside???",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Greenhouse Upgrade",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Is your greenhouse ready for a super-bloom? Collaborate with Lutz to upgrade your greenhouse and welcome all the flowers to the Merry Meadows.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Greenhouse Cabin Furniture",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Florals never go out of style! Now you can style your cabins in a whole new way… gather your flowers and let’s see what your green thumb can create!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45303325/e856967e47ef65331262ea6350c1a783e5f2a8ef.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rainbow Reef Revival",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s a Rainbow Refresh! Now when you clean up the reef, coral will grow like never before; and who will live in these new cabins?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Visitors",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some new watery wanderers are on their way to Friendship Island. Clear out some Rainbow Reef cabins to welcome them in!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Undersea Secrets",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hangyodon and his friends feel like something is a little fishy in the Rainbow Reef. Follow the clues to find a new sort of treasure beneath the waves!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We can’t wait for you to dive in and see all the amazing new features on Friendship Island! Happy Adventuring",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45303325/428db529b374e53147bb4bbebd77bde6c32e2fef.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Also, here are some of the issues we fixed for CU7",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Characters",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Usahana will give full XP, regardless of what level she is. The following changes will be made to Usahana's friendship level for players:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If level was 25 or greater, set to max (35)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If level was 24 --> 33",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If level was 23 --> 29",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If level was 22 --> 25",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If level was 21 --> 23: Quests",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players who completed TOPHAT's birthday celebration but do not have his balloon recipe will be given the crafting plans upon logging in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players who completed \"Power Up the Gate\" but did not receive the Yellow Power Crystal Decoration will be given the crafting plans upon logging in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where Cogimyun could appear in both forms during “Saving Snacks.”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players should no longer be softlocked on \"Balloons and Bluffs\" due to balloon placements.: Furniture and Clothing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The lobby flooring in Cloud Island, Icy Peak, and Merry Meadows have been adjusted and fixed to have their original coloring.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "2026 event clothing for Hugs & Hearts, Colorblaze Carnival, Lighttime Jubilee, and Month of Meh should now count towards Poron's requirements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed clipping and placement issues for hats, cabin doorways, and event balloons.: Characters and Visitors",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players should be able to interact with items and characters after Rockadoodler Roundup while using Cogimyun as a companion.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nina will no longer be stuck wearing her visitor outfit if asked to change.: Collections and Items",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various collection issues have been fixed, including arcade music discs appearing in the wrong collection, unavailable City Town furniture collection items, and final figurine rewards becoming unobtainable in some cases.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed duplicate flooring and wallpaper tags in filters, and restored the missing City Town tag for the Violet and Black Loose City Shirt.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed achievement and count tracking issues, including Wheatflour Wonderland achievements and the collect count in Sashimi Spire.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added separate Creation Station and Chef's Station tabs in the inventory.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added more sorting options across screens.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a dedicated filter icon for items made at the Creation Station.: Misc",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the Ice Breaker achievement to show the correct 2D icon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Add All and +10 / -10 controls when donating or recycling multiple items.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various translation and text fixes.: © 2026 Sunblink.: [p align=\"start\"]© 2026 SANRIO CO., LTD. Used Under License.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
