  {
   "id": "hello-kitty-island-adventure-254871@post-2025-11-19",
   "gameId": "hello-kitty-island-adventure-254871",
   "displayName": "CU4 has arrived! Hop to it and celebrate!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-11-19T20:06:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45303325/befe21ee86e2266c085125045d6a60d4fdac4e02.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Amphibian Avatars",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you’ve been daydreaming about being an axolotl, then we have good news: We can run around Friendship Island with amazing amphibian avatars! Get ready to hop in and have a ribbiting good time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quality of Life Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Be sure to check out some quality of life improvements, like sorting in Tuxedosam’s Dye Station, sorting for comics and music discs, and… favoriting inventory items!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Moonlit Mystery",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What's a more extreme environment than Friendship Island? The Moon, of course. Wish me mell and Nina might just figure out how to grow something in low gravity… Welcome Bubbaluna and Cosmic flowers~",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Visitors",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Visitors have packed their bags and are journeying to Friendship Island. Meet the LittleTwinStars’ friends Neko and Kuma, and Retsuko’s… work acquaintances Chief Komiya and Kabae!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "What’s this?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, keep an eye out too, there are rumors of a certain Narluga…",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45303325/af59c062c6a0c0ea00ebda2a4247d74b53099755.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "© 2025 Sunblink.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]© 2025 SANRIO CO., LTD. Used Under License.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
